            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Franciska Tamas Bittan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So easy and a family favorite! I add brown sugar into the mix (as desired) to make it a bit sweater than add brown sugar onto the buttered baking pan and on top to caramelize. I've made this both in casserole dish and individual muffin pans.",
